{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/guidance/help-with-property-on-your-self-assessment-tax-return","content_id":"48397392-ac1d-4aad-b505-19605fb6d4c8","description":"Find information on completing the UK property and other property sections of your Self Assessment tax return.","details":{"attachments":[],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>You will need to declare income from property on your Self Assessment tax return if you have earned over £1,000 from:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>\n    <p>renting out property in the UK or overseas</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>letting furnished rooms in your own home</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>furnished holiday lettings in the UK or European Economic Area (EEA)</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>premiums from leasing UK land</p>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Before filling in your tax return, you can:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>\n    <p>find out about <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/guidance/tax-free-allowances-on-property-and-trading-income\">annual tax-free allowances for property or trading income</a></p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>work out <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/guidance/income-tax-when-you-rent-out-a-property-working-out-your-rental-income\">your rental income if you rent out property</a></p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>find out if you can <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/guidance/claiming-capital-allowances-for-structures-and-buildings\">claim capital allowances for structures and buildings</a></p>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2 id=\"helpsheets-for-filling-in-your-tax-return\">Helpsheets for filling in your tax return</h2>\n\n<p>Helpsheets provide information that can help you complete your Self Assessment tax return, such as:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>checking if you qualify for a relief</li>\n  <li>working out figures you might need to include in your return</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"letting-property\">Letting property</h3>\n\n<p>Read helpsheets about:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>\n    <p>the <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/rent-a-room-for-traders-hs223-self-assessment-helpsheet\">Rent a Room Scheme (HS223)</a></p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>tax rules for <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/furnished-holiday-lettings-hs253-self-assessment-helpsheet\">furnished holiday lettings (HS253)</a></p>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"tax-reliefs\">Tax reliefs</h3>\n\n<p>Read helpsheets about:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>\n    <p>the <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/limit-on-income-tax-reliefs-hs204-self-assessment-helpsheet\">limit on Income Tax reliefs (HS204)</a></p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>when you can claim <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/agricultural-land-hs251-self-assessment-helpsheet\">agricultural land loss relief (HS251)</a></p>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"capital-allowances\">Capital allowances</h3>\n\n<p>Read the helpsheet about <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/capital-allowances-and-balancing-charges-hs252-self-assessment-helpsheet\">capital allowances and balancing charges (HS252)</a>.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"hmrc-youtube-videos\">HMRC YouTube videos</h2>\n\n<h3 id=\"youtube-playlist-about-uk-property\">YouTube playlist about UK property</h3>\n\n<p>Watch <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL8EcnheDt1zh5Yjk8_LaPczeX98PsF63T\">a YouTube video playlist about UK property income</a> on your tax return. You’ll learn about:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>filling in tax returns if you have income from a property</li>\n  <li>Rent a Room relief</li>\n  <li>joint lettings</li>\n  <li>the property income allowance</li>\n  <li>rent, rates, insurance and ground rent</li>\n  <li>property repairs and maintenance</li>\n  <li>loan interest and other financial costs</li>\n  <li>other allowance property expenses</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"recorded-webinar-on-uk-property\">Recorded webinar on UK property</h3>\n\n<p>Watch a video of a recorded webinar about the UK property section of your online tax return.</p>\n\n<p><a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=F7INjKze7iY\">The UK property section of your online tax return</a></p>\n\n<p>You will learn about:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>rent a room relief</li>\n  <li>joint letting</li>\n  <li>furnished holiday lettings</li>\n  <li>expenses and allowances</li>\n</ul>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"The webinar about filling in the UK property section of your tax return has been updated with the latest version.","public_timestamp":"2025-09-11T13:39:22Z"},{"note":"Added Welsh translation","public_timestamp":"2025-04-15T10:35:07Z"},{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2025-01-22T00:00:00Z"}],"emphasised_organisations":["6667cce2-e809-4e21-ae09-cb0bdc1ddda3"],"first_public_at":"2025-01-22T00:00:00.000+00:00","headers":[{"headers":[{"id":"letting-property","level":3,"text":"Letting property"},{"id":"tax-reliefs","level":3,"text":"Tax reliefs"},{"id":"capital-allowances","level":3,"text":"Capital allowances"}],"id":"helpsheets-for-filling-in-your-tax-return","level":2,"text":"Helpsheets for filling in your tax return"},{"headers":[{"id":"youtube-playlist-about-uk-property","level":3,"text":"YouTube playlist about UK property"},{"id":"recorded-webinar-on-uk-property","level":3,"text":"Recorded webinar on UK property"}],"id":"hmrc-youtube-videos","level":2,"text":"HMRC YouTube videos"}],"political":false,"related_mainstream_content":["f29ca4a8-8ed9-4b0f-bb6a-11e373095dee"],"tags":{"browse_pages":[]}},"document_type":"detailed_guide","first_published_at":"2025-01-22T00:00:00+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/guidance/help-with-property-on-your-self-assessment-tax-return.cy","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/guidance/help-with-property-on-your-self-assessment-tax-return.cy","base_path":"/guidance/help-with-property-on-your-self-assessment-tax-return.cy","content_id":"48397392-ac1d-4aad-b505-19605fb6d4c8","document_type":"detailed_guide","links":{},"locale":"cy","public_updated_at":"2025-09-11T13:39:22Z","schema_name":"detaile